<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-intro shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">ORVIA / MATERIAL &amp; APPLICATION REVIEW</p>
  <h1>Surface <em>Lab.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead">A material name is only a starting point. Compatibility follows the actual surface, geometry, coating, artwork and intended use.</p>
</section>

<section class="section shell">
  <div class="surface-intro">
    <p>HDC keeps product, material, production route and page configuration as separate records. A material listed here does not guarantee that every object made from it can be printed.</p>
    <a class="button" href="/quote">Ask about a surface ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div class="surface-grid">
    <% siteContent.surfaces.forEach((surface, i) => { %>
      <article class="surface-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">SURFACE / 0<%= i + 1 %></span>
        <h2><%= surface[0] %></h2>
        <p><%= surface[1] %></p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/quote">Request a compatibility review ↗</a>
      </article>
    <% }); %>
  </div>
  <div class="review-note">
    <p class="eyebrow">PROCESS CANDIDATES</p>
    <p>UV printing and UV DTF are distinct processes used across many products. Neither is assigned to a surface or product here without a product-specific approved production profile.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
